  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lao PDR Mobilizing Ethnic Communities for Improved Livelihoods and Wellbeing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To pilot an innovative livelihood focused community-driven development (CDD) program in FOUR poverty reduction priority districts within TWO provinces (Huaphan in the North and Savannaketh in the South) enabling 28,800 households in ethnic communities in rural areas in Lao PDR to improve their livelihoods and well-being through group-based activities.</narrative>
  </description>
